* Ref: real III+ numeric error parameter/memvar picture follow-up.
* MINT-ERRORS: 58 61 58 58 61 58
? "[FNS-BEGIN]"
? "STORE-LOG"
STORE LOG(-100) TO X
? "X",X
? "STORE-SQRT"
STORE SQRT(-1) TO X
? "X",X
? "STORE-INF"
STORE LOG(0) TO X
? "X",X
? "PASS-LOG"
DO PICOUT WITH LOG(-100)
? "PASS-SQRT"
DO PICOUT WITH SQRT(-1)
? "PASS-INF"
DO PICOUT WITH LOG(0)
? "[FNS-END]"
RETURN
PROCEDURE PICOUT
PARAMETERS P
? "P",P
RETURN
